{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51398","headline":"石佛谷 · 皇甫曙","name":"石佛谷","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"空（〖1〗《全唐诗》三六九作皇甫湜诗，第十五句「鸟迹」《图书集成》作「鸟趾」，十七句「间」作「阔」。\n〖2〗《古今图书集成·职方典》三六四《泽州部》〖《金石录》卷十着录：「唐皇甫曙《题石佛谷诗》，李道夷正书，开成元年十一月。\n」《宝刻业编》卷二十亦着录。\n皇甫曙於大和九年至开成二年间任泽州刺史，详郁贤皓《唐刺史考》卷八。\n诗即曙刺泽州时作。\n《全唐诗》误归皇甫湜，应移正。\n〗）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫曙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51398.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51398","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}